---

<!-- Three paper bands stacked in flow: cream carries on from RimaxIntro's closing
     tear, then blue, then cream again. Each band pulls its OWN torn edge up above
     itself (bottom-full), so band heights stay content-driven and the section
     reflows instead of holding the mockup's fixed ratio.
     One z ladder: paper 0, collage 10, closing tear 20, copy 30. -->
<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-cream h-screen">
  <p>Pero un día, nos dio por ponerle cuidado a esa silla que ha estado ahí toda la vida.</p>
</section>
